  <item>
    <title>03.我为什么不敢太开心？原来这是“快乐恐惧症”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6767a6a415a5fd520e8d369f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6767a6a415a5fd520e8d369f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 05:45:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当快乐变成了一种恐惧，又如何自处？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjg7N0pnNuaulngxceb5CPSVz3CM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>2024年12月20日，夜，京通快速路的无数个月亮</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【主播】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿婷：六年社会新闻记者；进入自我周旋期，尝试寻找自己</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【时间轴】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 快乐出现的那一刻，意味着某件不好的事情也在酝酿之中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 那当快乐变成了一种负担，我还能怎么办呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 原来我这个叫做快乐恐惧症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 个体对快乐的恐惧可能源于对幸福的负面认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 不仅负面的情绪是需要调节，愉快的情感也需要调节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 我变成了这种乐极生悲传统的囚徒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 你的所有情绪都是有”合法性“的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 偶尔散发出对快乐的恐惧，那么也去接受它、认识它、感受它</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒【本期提到的内容】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>刷了10分钟短视频，确诊一身病-《青年范儿》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>缓解精神内耗：道德绑架别人，然后自言自语-《与我周旋》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Slack Lyfe - Ryan McCaffrey_Go By Ocean</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>每月至少周旋两次，希望我不辜负</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如果你有周旋故事，也可以告诉我：ltina1993@163.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvpKu6B8kG8KJYWfKgiNdlIPshIk.m4a" length="14973351" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:09</itunes:duration>
